Okay a bit short but this is my first review ><;;

Loved it, very true to the comic, even though the beginning was a bit loose, but only a little. Sometimes Christian Bale's delivery of lines while Batman was a bit shaky...I think he was trying to deepen his voice... The new Batmobile is beautiful, the suit gorgeous (AND NO nipples), the gadgets amazing... Great action, good casting and acting. Well written too. The sets were near perfect and dark/dreary just like Gotham should be. But the movie is sweeeeeeet. MUCH better than when I went to go see Batman and Robin at an early bird showing and wanted the $2 I spent to get in back...

Josh's Rating: A+ definitely a must see, especially if you are a Batman fan
